                    <div class="testimonial-author">
                        <div class="t-avatar">P</div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="t-name">Priya Mishra</div>
                            <div class="t-role">MPPSC Aspirant</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <div class="testimonial-stars">★★★★★</div>
                    <blockquote>I love the Full Day plan — sitting here from 6 AM to 11 PM with my reserved seat gives
