                    <div class="testimonial-author">
                        <div class="t-avatar">A</div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="t-name">Amit Patel</div>
                            <div class="t-role">UPSC Aspirant</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <div class="testimonial-stars">★★★★★</div>
                    <blockquote>The 1000+ reference books saved me thousands of rupees. No need to buy expensive books —
                        everything is right there. Plus the atmosphere is incredibly focused.</blockquote>
                    <div class="testimonial-author">
                        <div class="t-avatar">S</div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="t-name">Sneha Gupta</div>
